  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n**1) - and ×**\n\n→ 9 - 182 + **14 ÷ 67** × 33 = 151\n\n→ 9 - 182 + **14/67 ×**** 33** = 151\n\n→ **9** - 182 **+ 462/67** = 151\n\n→ 1065/67 - 182 ≠ 151\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**2) × and +**\n\n→ 9 + 182 × **14 ÷ 67** – 33 = 151\n\n→ 9 + **182 × 14/67** – 33 = 151\n\n→ **9 + 2548/67** – 33 = 151\n\n→ 3151/67 – 33 ≠ 151\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**3) ÷ and -**\n\n→ 9 × 182 + 14 - **67 ÷ 33** = 151\n\n→ **9 × 182** + 14 - 67/33 = 151\n\n→ **1638 + 14** - 67/33 = 151\n\n→ 1652 - 67/33 ≠ 151\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n4) **÷ and +**\n\n→ 9 × **182 ÷ 14** + 67 – 33 = 151\n\n→ **9 × 13** + 67 – 33 = 151\n\n→ **117 + 67** – 33 = 151\n\n→ 184 – 33 = 151\n\n→ 151 = 151\n\n→** LHS = RHS ⇒ Satisfies the logic.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****÷ and +\"**.",
